## Part of a Busier Year for Corporate Work on the Costa del Sol

ECOC 2026 is the largest event of this kind we have worked on this year, but it is not an isolated one. In May we handled the technical production for the [PROGOLD SUMMIT 2026 at the Hotel Melia Costa del Sol in Torremolinos](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-flawless-audiovisual-production-at-progold-summit-2026-in-torremolinos/), and we have supported [BMotion on corporate projects in Marbella](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-premium-technical-support-for-bmotions-high-profile-corporate-project-in-marbella/) and [in Benahavis](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-flawless-audiovisual-production-for-bmotion-in-benahavis/).

The pattern behind all of them is the same: international organisers arriving in a province they do not know, on a schedule with no slack in it, needing a local supplier who already knows the venue, the access rules and the loading times.

## Exhibiting at FYCMA? Talk to Us Early

If you are taking a stand at a congress in Malaga, the single most useful thing you can do is tell your AV supplier what your stand is made of before it is built. Panel type, wall dimensions, where the power drop lands and whether the designer left a cable route. That five minute conversation is what separates a clean install from an improvised one on the morning the doors open.

